<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Online Voting Awareness Portal</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="logo">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/50x50/FF9933/FFFFFF?text=🇮🇳" alt="Indian Flag Icon" class="flag-icon">
                <h1>Online Voting Awareness Portal</h1>
            </div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#constitution">Constitution</a></li>
                <li><a href="#voting">Voting Guide</a></li>
                <li><a href="#quiz">Quiz</a></li>
                <li><a href="#simulator">Simulator</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hamburger">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section id="home" class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h2>Empower Democracy: Vote Online with Pride</h2>
            <p>Discover the essence of India's Constitution and your role in shaping the nation's future through informed online voting.</p>
            <button class="cta-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('constitution')">Learn About Constitution</button>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x400/128807/FFFFFF?text=Indian+Parliament" alt="Indian Parliament">
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="constitution" class="section">
        <h2>The Indian Constitution: Foundation of Democracy</h2>
        <p>The Constitution of India, adopted on 26th November 1949, is the supreme law of the land. It lays down the framework for democratic governance, fundamental rights, and duties of citizens.</p>
        <div class="timeline">
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>1950: Adoption</h3>
                <p>Enforced on 26th January 1950, marking India's transition to a republic.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>Fundamental Rights</h3>
                <p>Articles 12-35: Right to equality, freedom, against exploitation, etc.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>Fundamental Duties</h3>
                <p>Added in 1976: Respect the Constitution, promote harmony, protect environment.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>Directive Principles</h3>
                <p>Guidelines for governance to ensure social and economic justice.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="voting" class="section alt-bg">
        <h2>How to Vote Online: Your Democratic Duty</h2>
        <p>Online voting in India is secure and accessible. Register, verify, and cast your vote from anywhere.</p>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
                <h3>1. Register</h3>
                <p>Use the Voter Helpline App or website to register with your Aadhaar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <h3>2. Verify</h3>
                <p>Receive OTP and confirm your details.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <h3>3. Vote</h3>
                <p>Select your candidate securely via the portal.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="quiz" class="section">
        <h2>Test Your Knowledge: Constitution Quiz</h2>
        <div id="quiz-container">
            <div id="question">Question will appear here.</div>
            <div id="options"></div>
            <button id="next-btn" style="display:none;">Next</button>
        </div>
        <div id="result" style="display:none;"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="simulator" class="section alt-bg">
        <h2>Online Voting Simulator</h2>
        <p>Experience the voting process virtually.</p>
        <div id="simulator-container">
            <button id="start-sim">Start Simulation</button>
            <div id="sim-steps" style="display:none;">
                <p>Step 1: Enter Voter ID</p>
                <input type="text" id="voter-id" placeholder="Enter Voter ID">
                <button id="verify-btn">Verify</button>
                <div id="vote-options" style="display:none;">
                    <p>Select Candidate:</p>
                    <button class="candidate">Candidate A</button>
                    <button class="candidate">Candidate B</button>
                    <button class="candidate">Candidate C</button>
                </div>
                <div id="confirmation" style="display:none;">Vote Cast Successfully!</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <form id="contact-form">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Name" required>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Email" required>
            <textarea placeholder="Message" required></textarea>
            <button type="submit">Send</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 Online Voting Awareness Portal. Inspired by India's Constitution. <button id="dark-mode-toggle">Toggle Dark Mode</button></p>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html> 
